{"id":"neumorphism-soft","title":"Neumorphism — Soft UI Player","description":"The 2019–2020 soft-UI trend — monochrome surfaces extruded and pressed with dual light/dark shadows, like everything is carved from the same soft material. Fits music players, settings and fitness widgets.","tags":["neumorphism","soft-ui","player"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:55:12.963Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Neumorphism — Soft UI Player\ndescription: The 2019–2020 soft-UI trend — monochrome surfaces extruded and pressed with dual light/dark shadows, like everything is carved from the same soft material. Fits music players, settings and fitness widgets.\ntags: [neumorphism, soft-ui, player]\norder: 14\n---\n\n# Neumorphism — Soft UI Player\n\nEverything is the same colour as the background; shape comes only from paired shadows —\ndark bottom-right, light top-left for raised, inverted for pressed. A working music\nplayer plus small widgets, all carved from one surface.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Surface | `#e0e5ec` — bg, cards and controls share it |\n| Raised | `9px 9px 18px rgba(163,177,198,0.6), -9px -9px 18px rgba(255,255,255,0.85)` |\n| Pressed (inset) | `inset 6px 6px 12px rgba(163,177,198,0.7), inset -6px -6px 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.8)` |\n| Text | `#5b6472` primary · `#98a2b3` muted |\n| Radius | 20–24px everywhere |\n\n## Interaction\n\nPlay/pause runs the progress bar with a real timer, prev/next swap tracks, the volume\nslider and toggle switch are fully styled neumorphic controls, and the ambient switch\nflips the page between light and dark soft-UI.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Neumorphism — Soft UI Player\n\nEverything is the same colour as the background; shape comes only from paired shadows —\ndark bottom-right, light top-left for raised, inverted for pressed. A working music\nplayer plus small widgets, all carved from one surface.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Surface | `#e0e5ec` — bg, cards and controls share it |\n| Raised | `9px 9px 18px rgba(163,177,198,0.6), -9px -9px 18px rgba(255,255,255,0.85)` |\n| Pressed (inset) | `inset 6px 6px 12px rgba(163,177,198,0.7), inset -6px -6px 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.8)` |\n| Text | `#5b6472` primary · `#98a2b3` muted |\n| Radius | 20–24px everywhere |\n\n## Interaction\n\nPlay/pause runs the progress bar with a real timer, prev/next swap tracks, the volume\nslider and toggle switch are fully styled neumorphic controls, and the ambient switch\nflips the page between light and dark soft-UI.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Soft UI — Neumorphism Player\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --bg: #e0e5ec; --ink: #5b6472; --mut: #98a2b3;\n    --out: 9px 9px 18px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.6), -9px -9px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n    --out-sm: 5px 5px 10px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.6), -5px -5px 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n    --in: inset 6px 6px 12px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.7), inset -6px -6px 12px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n  }\n  body.dark { --bg: #2b2f36; --ink: #c3cad6; --mut: #7d8593;\n    --out: 9px 9px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), -9px -9px 18px rgba(70, 78, 90, 0.35);\n    --out-sm: 5px 5px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), -5px -5px 10px rgba(70, 78, 90, 0.35);\n    --in: inset 6px 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), inset -6px -6px 12px rgba(70, 78, 90, 0.3);\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 26px; padding: 40px 16px; transition: background 0.4s; }\n\n  .switch-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--mut); }\n  .toggle { width: 58px; height: 30px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: var(--in); position: relative; cursor: pointer; border: 0; background: var(--bg); }\n  .toggle .knob { position: absolute; top: 4px; left: 4px; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg); box-shadow: var(--out-sm); transition: left 0.25s; }\n  body.dark .toggle .knob { left: 32px; }\n\n  .player { width: 340px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 26px; box-shadow: var(--out); padding: 30px 28px 34px; text-align: center; transition: background 0.4s; }\n  .art { width: 150px; height: 150px; margin: 0 auto 22px; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: var(--out); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 54px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }\n  .art::after { content: \"\"; position: absolute; inset: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a8b4c8, #dfe5ee); }\n  body.dark .art::after { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3a4150, #565f6e); }\n  .art .note { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n  .playing .art { animation: pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes pulse { 50% { box-shadow: var(--out), 0 0 0 10px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.12); } }\n\n  .title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }\n  .artist { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--mut); margin-top: 3px; }\n\n  .progress { height: 12px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: var(--in); margin: 24px 6px 6px; position: relative; }\n  .progress .fill { position: absolute; top: 3px; bottom: 3px; left: 3px; width: 30%; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8fa2bd, #b7c4d8); }\n  .times { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11px; color: var(--mut); padding: 0 8px; }\n\n  .controls { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 22px; margin-top: 26px; }\n  .cbtn { width: 54px; height: 54px; border-radius: 50%; border: 0; background: var(--bg); box-shadow: var(--out-sm); color: var(--ink); font-size: 17px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.12s; }\n  .cbtn:active, .cbtn.pressed { box-shadow: var(--in); font-size: 15px; }\n  .cbtn.play { width: 68px; height: 68px; font-size: 22px; }\n  .vol { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 26px; padding: 0 8px; }\n  .vol span { color: var(--mut); font-size: 14px; }\n  input[type=\"range\"] { -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none; flex: 1; height: 12px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: var(--in); outline: none; background: var(--bg); }\n  input[type=\"range\"]::-webkit-slider-thumb { -webkit-appearance: none; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg); box-shadow: 3px 3px 7px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.7), -3px -3px 7px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); cursor: pointer; }\n\n  .tiles { display: flex; gap: 24px; }\n  .tile { width: 150px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: var(--out); padding: 18px 20px; transition: background 0.4s; }\n  .tile .k { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mut); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .tile .v { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .tile .s { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mut); margin-top: 2px; }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"switch-row\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"toggle\" id=\"modeToggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle dark ambient\">\u003cspan class=\"knob\">\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n    Dark ambient\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"player\" id=\"player\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"art\">\u003cspan class=\"note\">♪\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"title\" id=\"tTitle\">Soft Rain\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"artist\" id=\"tArtist\">Ambient Lo-Fi · Vol. 3\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"progress\">\u003cdiv class=\"fill\" id=\"fill\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"times\">\u003cspan id=\"tNow\">0:00\u003c/span>\u003cspan id=\"tDur\">3:45\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"controls\">\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cbtn\" id=\"prev\">⏮\u003c/button>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cbtn play\" id=\"play\">▶\u003c/button>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cbtn\" id=\"next\">⏭\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"vol\">\u003cspan>🔈\u003c/span>\u003cinput type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"70\">\u003cspan>🔊\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"tiles\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tile\">\u003cdiv class=\"k\">Steps today\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\" id=\"steps\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s\">goal 10,000\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tile\">\u003cdiv class=\"k\">Living room\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\">22.5°C\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s\">humidity 48%\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // tracks\n    const tracks = [\n      { t: \"Soft Rain\", a: \"Ambient Lo-Fi · Vol. 3\", dur: 225 },\n      { t: \"Paper Walls\", a: \"Kanvas Kamar\", dur: 198 },\n      { t: \"Slow Clouds\", a: \"Mei & The Machine\", dur: 254 }\n    ];\n    let cur = 0, playing = false, pos = 94, last = 0;\n    const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n    const fmt = s => Math.floor(s / 60) + \":\" + String(Math.floor(s % 60)).padStart(2, \"0\");\n\n    function renderTrack() {\n      $(\"tTitle\").textContent = tracks[cur].t;\n      $(\"tArtist\").textContent = tracks[cur].a;\n      $(\"tDur\").textContent = fmt(tracks[cur].dur);\n      pos = 0; renderPos();\n    }\n    function renderPos() {\n      const dur = tracks[cur].dur, p = Math.min(pos / dur, 1);\n      $(\"fill\").style.width = (3 + p * 94) + \"%\";\n      $(\"tNow\").textContent = fmt(pos);\n    }\n    function loop(t) {\n      if (playing) {\n        pos += (t - last) / 1000;\n        if (pos >= tracks[cur].dur) { cur = (cur + 1) % tracks.length; renderTrack(); }\n        else renderPos();\n      }\n      last = t;\n      requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n\n    $(\"play\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      playing = !playing;\n      this.textContent = playing ? \"⏸\" : \"▶\";\n      $(\"player\").classList.toggle(\"playing\", playing);\n    });\n    $(\"prev\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => { cur = (cur - 1 + tracks.length) % tracks.length; renderTrack(); });\n    $(\"next\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => { cur = (cur + 1) % tracks.length; renderTrack(); });\n    document.querySelector('input[type=\"range\"]').addEventListener(\"input\", e => {\n      pos = (e.target.value / 100) * tracks[cur].dur; renderPos();\n    });\n\n    // dark ambient toggle\n    $(\"modeToggle\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => document.body.classList.toggle(\"dark\"));\n\n    // steps count-up\n    const steps = $(\"steps\"), target = 8412, t0 = performance.now();\n    (function tick(t) {\n      const p = Math.min((t - t0 - 400) / 1400, 1);\n      if (p > 0) steps.textContent = Math.round(target * (1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3))).toLocaleString();\n      if (p \u003c 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n    })(performance.now());\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>Soft UI — Neumorphism Player\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  :root { --bg: #e0e5ec; --ink: #5b6472; --mut: #98a2b3;\n    --out: 9px 9px 18px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.6), -9px -9px 18px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n    --out-sm: 5px 5px 10px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.6), -5px -5px 10px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n    --in: inset 6px 6px 12px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.7), inset -6px -6px 12px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\n  }\n  body.dark { --bg: #2b2f36; --ink: #c3cad6; --mut: #7d8593;\n    --out: 9px 9px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), -9px -9px 18px rgba(70, 78, 90, 0.35);\n    --out-sm: 5px 5px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55), -5px -5px 10px rgba(70, 78, 90, 0.35);\n    --in: inset 6px 6px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), inset -6px -6px 12px rgba(70, 78, 90, 0.3);\n  }\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 26px; padding: 40px 16px; transition: background 0.4s; }\n\n  .switch-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--mut); }\n  .toggle { width: 58px; height: 30px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: var(--in); position: relative; cursor: pointer; border: 0; background: var(--bg); }\n  .toggle .knob { position: absolute; top: 4px; left: 4px; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg); box-shadow: var(--out-sm); transition: left 0.25s; }\n  body.dark .toggle .knob { left: 32px; }\n\n  .player { width: 340px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 26px; box-shadow: var(--out); padding: 30px 28px 34px; text-align: center; transition: background 0.4s; }\n  .art { width: 150px; height: 150px; margin: 0 auto 22px; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: var(--out); display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 54px; overflow: hidden; position: relative; }\n  .art::after { content: \"\"; position: absolute; inset: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a8b4c8, #dfe5ee); }\n  body.dark .art::after { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3a4150, #565f6e); }\n  .art .note { position: relative; z-index: 1; }\n  .playing .art { animation: pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes pulse { 50% { box-shadow: var(--out), 0 0 0 10px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.12); } }\n\n  .title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }\n  .artist { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--mut); margin-top: 3px; }\n\n  .progress { height: 12px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: var(--in); margin: 24px 6px 6px; position: relative; }\n  .progress .fill { position: absolute; top: 3px; bottom: 3px; left: 3px; width: 30%; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8fa2bd, #b7c4d8); }\n  .times { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11px; color: var(--mut); padding: 0 8px; }\n\n  .controls { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 22px; margin-top: 26px; }\n  .cbtn { width: 54px; height: 54px; border-radius: 50%; border: 0; background: var(--bg); box-shadow: var(--out-sm); color: var(--ink); font-size: 17px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.12s; }\n  .cbtn:active, .cbtn.pressed { box-shadow: var(--in); font-size: 15px; }\n  .cbtn.play { width: 68px; height: 68px; font-size: 22px; }\n  .vol { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 26px; padding: 0 8px; }\n  .vol span { color: var(--mut); font-size: 14px; }\n  input[type=\"range\"] { -webkit-appearance: none; appearance: none; flex: 1; height: 12px; border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: var(--in); outline: none; background: var(--bg); }\n  input[type=\"range\"]::-webkit-slider-thumb { -webkit-appearance: none; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--bg); box-shadow: 3px 3px 7px rgba(163, 177, 198, 0.7), -3px -3px 7px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); cursor: pointer; }\n\n  .tiles { display: flex; gap: 24px; }\n  .tile { width: 150px; background: var(--bg); border-radius: 22px; box-shadow: var(--out); padding: 18px 20px; transition: background 0.4s; }\n  .tile .k { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mut); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n  .tile .v { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 6px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n  .tile .s { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--mut); margin-top: 2px; }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"switch-row\">\n    \u003cbutton class=\"toggle\" id=\"modeToggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle dark ambient\">\u003cspan class=\"knob\">\u003c/span>\u003c/button>\n    Dark ambient\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"player\" id=\"player\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"art\">\u003cspan class=\"note\">♪\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"title\" id=\"tTitle\">Soft Rain\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"artist\" id=\"tArtist\">Ambient Lo-Fi · Vol. 3\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"progress\">\u003cdiv class=\"fill\" id=\"fill\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"times\">\u003cspan id=\"tNow\">0:00\u003c/span>\u003cspan id=\"tDur\">3:45\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"controls\">\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cbtn\" id=\"prev\">⏮\u003c/button>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cbtn play\" id=\"play\">▶\u003c/button>\n      \u003cbutton class=\"cbtn\" id=\"next\">⏭\u003c/button>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"vol\">\u003cspan>🔈\u003c/span>\u003cinput type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"70\">\u003cspan>🔊\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cdiv class=\"tiles\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tile\">\u003cdiv class=\"k\">Steps today\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\" id=\"steps\">0\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s\">goal 10,000\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tile\">\u003cdiv class=\"k\">Living room\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"v\">22.5°C\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"s\">humidity 48%\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // tracks\n    const tracks = [\n      { t: \"Soft Rain\", a: \"Ambient Lo-Fi · Vol. 3\", dur: 225 },\n      { t: \"Paper Walls\", a: \"Kanvas Kamar\", dur: 198 },\n      { t: \"Slow Clouds\", a: \"Mei & The Machine\", dur: 254 }\n    ];\n    let cur = 0, playing = false, pos = 94, last = 0;\n    const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n    const fmt = s => Math.floor(s / 60) + \":\" + String(Math.floor(s % 60)).padStart(2, \"0\");\n\n    function renderTrack() {\n      $(\"tTitle\").textContent = tracks[cur].t;\n      $(\"tArtist\").textContent = tracks[cur].a;\n      $(\"tDur\").textContent = fmt(tracks[cur].dur);\n      pos = 0; renderPos();\n    }\n    function renderPos() {\n      const dur = tracks[cur].dur, p = Math.min(pos / dur, 1);\n      $(\"fill\").style.width = (3 + p * 94) + \"%\";\n      $(\"tNow\").textContent = fmt(pos);\n    }\n    function loop(t) {\n      if (playing) {\n        pos += (t - last) / 1000;\n        if (pos >= tracks[cur].dur) { cur = (cur + 1) % tracks.length; renderTrack(); }\n        else renderPos();\n      }\n      last = t;\n      requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n\n    $(\"play\").addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      playing = !playing;\n      this.textContent = playing ? \"⏸\" : \"▶\";\n      $(\"player\").classList.toggle(\"playing\", playing);\n    });\n    $(\"prev\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => { cur = (cur - 1 + tracks.length) % tracks.length; renderTrack(); });\n    $(\"next\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => { cur = (cur + 1) % tracks.length; renderTrack(); });\n    document.querySelector('input[type=\"range\"]').addEventListener(\"input\", e => {\n      pos = (e.target.value / 100) * tracks[cur].dur; renderPos();\n    });\n\n    // dark ambient toggle\n    $(\"modeToggle\").addEventListener(\"click\", () => document.body.classList.toggle(\"dark\"));\n\n    // steps count-up\n    const steps = $(\"steps\"), target = 8412, t0 = performance.now();\n    (function tick(t) {\n      const p = Math.min((t - t0 - 400) / 1400, 1);\n      if (p > 0) steps.textContent = Math.round(target * (1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3))).toLocaleString();\n      if (p \u003c 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n    })(performance.now());\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}}